    title: 'Elden Ring: How to Defeat Malenia, Blade of Miquella',
    titleZh: '艾尔登法环：如何击败玛莲妮亚，米凯拉之刃',
    excerpt: 'Complete boss guide covering all phases, attack patterns, optimal builds, and cheese strategies for the hardest boss in Elden Ring.',
    excerptZh: '完整的Boss攻略，涵盖所有阶段、攻击模式、最佳配装，以及艾尔登法环最难Boss「米凯拉之刃」玛莲妮亚的逃课策略。',
    content: 'Malenia, Blade of Miquella, is widely considered the hardest boss in Elden Ring and arguably in all of Soulsborne history. This guide provides a comprehensive walkthrough for defeating her in melee, sorcery, and summon-assisted builds. Malenia has 14,500 HP (NG), 40,000 HP (NG+7). She deals 1,200-2,500 damage per combo (depending on your defense). Her Waterfowl Dance (Phase2, 3-stage attack) deals 3,000+ damage (can 1-shot a 60 Vigor build). This guide covers her 3-phase moveset (Phase1: 100-51% HP, Phase2: 50-21% HP, Phase3: 20-0% HP), her 12 unique attacks (including Waterfowl Dance, Scarlet Aeonia, and Phantom Spirits), and the 5 best strategies (Rivers of Blood + Mimic Tear, Blasphemous Blade + Tiche, Comet Azur + Mimic Tear, Moonveil + Black Knife Tiche, and the \'No-Hit\' parry-only strategy). Estimated completion time: 2-8 hours (depending on build). Difficulty: 10/10. Reward: Remembrance of the Rot Goddess (trade for Hand of Malenia katana or Scarlet Aeonia incantation).',
    coverImage: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633265486064-086b219458ec',
    gameId: 'elden-ring',
    gameSlug: 'elden-ring',
