    id: 'elden-ring-map-guide',
    slug: 'elden-ring-map-guide',
    title: 'Elden Ring: Complete Map Guide - All Locations',
    titleZh: '艾尔登法环：完整地图指南 - 全位置',
    excerpt: 'Every Site of Grace location, region breakdown, fast travel optimization, and hidden area discovery guide.',
    excerptZh: '艾尔登法环全地图完整指南，包含每一个赐福点位置、各区域详解、快速传送优化和隐藏区域发现攻略。',
    content: 'This comprehensive map guide covers every Site of Grace location in Elden Ring, organized by region (Limgrave, Liurnia, Caelid, Altus Plateau, Mountaintops of the Giants, and the underground areas). Each region includes detailed breakdowns of key locations, fast travel optimization tips, hidden area discovery methods, and recommended exploration paths. The guide also includes interactive maps for major legacy dungeons and secret areas like the Haligtree and Mohgwyn Palace.',
    coverImage: 'https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/1086940/header.jpg',
    gameId: 'elden-ring',
