    content: 'Ultimate Gwent guide covering every card location in the base game and DLCs. Includes optimal deck builds for Northern Realms spy strategy, Nilfgaard revive deck, Monsters muster swarm, Scoia\'tael ambush, and Skellige Storm decks.',
    coverImage: 'https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/292030/header.jpg',
    gameId: 'the-witcher-3',
