    title: 'Delta Force Beginner Guide: Operators, Weapons & Tactical Gameplay',
    titleZh: '三角洲行动新手入门指南：干员、武器与战术玩法',
    excerpt: 'Get started with Delta Force covering operator roles, weapon customization, map strategies, and tactical squad play.',
    excerptZh: '三角洲行动从零入门，涵盖干员定位、武器定制、地图策略和战术小队配合。',
    content: 'Delta Force (formerly Delta Force: Hawk Ops) is Team Jade\'s free-to-play tactical FPS featuring large-scale warfare and extraction modes. Learn operator synergies, weapon systems, and team tactics.',
    coverImage: 'https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/730/header.jpg',
